    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Slut Metamorphosis</strong> is a NTR (cheating) themed visual novel. Make choices and read through the story from both the male and female protagonist's perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474720/extras/b5f619450d0d98e9e2607a9b8791b7cc.avif?t=1753714868\" width=800 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not doing well financially when an older family friend Shoji offers to help out and lets you and your girlfriend Lana live with him in his fancy home until you get back up on your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you don't know is that Shoji might have ulteriot motives with your girlfriend... As you live in Shoji's home you notice Lana's outlook on life has been changing. She's always been a fashionista who wears a lot of makeup and dyes her hair blonde with a modern look on life, but lately she seems to be adopting more traditional Japanese norms and values...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474720/extras/b6d338feba87794911ab8f91c5b71d0c.avif?t=1753714868\" width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474720/extras/a2f18e11c9d869ee9a72b262622629d5.avif?t=1753714868\" width=764 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lana</strong> is your girlfriend. Her dream is to become a popular model one day. She does not like doing household chores and pushy overly masculine men.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474720/extras/135edc678e2f7040235bf5d06e9879f3.avif?t=1753714868\" width=764 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are playing as <strong>Ken</strong>, a guy who recently lost his lowe paying job and has no choice but to move in with an older family friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474720/extras/310a732545a49b6a2f86a75951c84bd8.avif?t=1753714868\" width=654 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoji\u00a0</strong>is an old family friend and a wealthy entrepreneur with a beautiful Japanese home. You're not sure whether you appreciate the way he looks at your girlfriend once in a while...</p>",
